Check packet receipts for timeout after the job loop

A receipt's timeout callback ran inside the job loop, where a callback that
sends a packet waits for ever, since Transport::outbound() waits for the
loop to finish. The Python reference runs the callback in its own thread.
The check now runs once the loop has finished.


